      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Too many people have been using for years the functionality that this new double tap menu button is overriding now, please just revert this change and let people manually add the big menu feature to any button they want.\n\nThere have been too many complains already in the open beta discussion to allow this new change on the game, and... its really hard to change the steamvr bindings to make the big menu not open, i've emulated it but i have to do a long press for the action menu and its an obnoxiously long long-press.",
